# Analytics-area rules

- Scaffold status (ADR 0007): schemas are provisional; no importers, dashboards or inference in
  phase one. `/ingest-tiktok-analytics` validates and stores only.
- Raw platform exports never enter git (`analytics/raw/` is gitignored); commit only
  normalised, schema-validated, redacted-where-needed observation records.
- One observation per video per capture date — append snapshots, never overwrite.
- Keep absolute counts and rates in their separate structures; never conflate distribution
  volume with conversion, or account growth with per-video performance.
- No causal claims from small samples: analytics outputs are hypotheses and experiment
  proposals until cohorts exist (phase 5).
- Every observation must reference a `video_production_manifest` via `video_id` — lineage is the
  point.
